{"id":"24c725a359792259","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-projective-space.md","title":"Projective Space","display":"df-projective-space — Projective Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-projective-space","aliases":["58-df-projective-space","Projective Space"],"display":"df-projective-space — Projective Space","depends_on":["[[58-df-equivalence-relation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-projective-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-projective-space</span><span>Projective Space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-projective-space — Projective Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"908bc7b079f5d25b\" href=\"?note=908bc7b079f5d25b\" title=\"58-df-equivalence-relation\">58-df-equivalence-relation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\">\\(\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProjectiveSpace}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\mathrm{ProjectiveSpace}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ScalarEquivalenceRelation}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\mathrm{ScalarEquivalenceRelation}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ScalarEquivalent}_S\\subseteq V^{4}\">\\(\\mathrm{ScalarEquivalent}_S\\subseteq V^{4}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\">\\(k\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,x,y\\in V\">\\(P,x,y\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S\\)</span> (equivalence-relation predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ScalarEquivalent}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ScalarEquivalent}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ScalarEquivalenceRelation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ScalarEquivalenceRelation}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProjectiveSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ProjectiveSpace}_S\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{RP}^n,\\mathbb{CP}^n\">\\(\\mathbb{RP}^n,\\mathbb{CP}^n\\)</span> (real and complex instances)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projective\\text{-}scalar\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ScalarEquivalent}_S(x,y,k,n)\\leftrightarrow\nk\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\\land n\\in\\omega\\land x,y\\in k^{n+1}\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\n\\exists\\lambda\\in k\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;(y=\\lambda x)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projective\\text{-}scalar\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ScalarEquivalent}_S(x,y,k,n)\\leftrightarrow\nk\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\\land n\\in\\omega\\land x,y\\in k^{n+1}\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\n\\exists\\lambda\\in k\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;(y=\\lambda x)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projective\\text{-}scalar\\text{-}relation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ScalarEquivalenceRelation}_S(E,k,n)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nk\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\\land n\\in\\omega\\\\\n&amp;\\land E=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in(k^{n+1}\\setminus\\{0\\})^2:\n\\mathrm{ScalarEquivalent}_S(x,y,k,n)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S(E,k^{n+1}\\setminus\\{0\\}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projective\\text{-}scalar\\text{-}relation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ScalarEquivalenceRelation}_S(E,k,n)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nk\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\\land n\\in\\omega\\\\\n&amp;\\land E=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in(k^{n+1}\\setminus\\{0\\})^2:\n\\mathrm{ScalarEquivalent}_S(x,y,k,n)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S(E,k^{n+1}\\setminus\\{0\\}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projective\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ProjectiveSpace}_S(P,k,n)\\leftrightarrow\nk\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\\land n\\in\\omega\\land\n\\exists E\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ScalarEquivalenceRelation}_S(E,k,n)\\land\nP=\\{[x]_E:x\\in k^{n+1}\\setminus\\{0\\}\\}\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projective\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ProjectiveSpace}_S(P,k,n)\\leftrightarrow\nk\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\\land n\\in\\omega\\land\n\\exists E\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ScalarEquivalenceRelation}_S(E,k,n)\\land\nP=\\{[x]_E:x\\in k^{n+1}\\setminus\\{0\\}\\}\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}real\\text{-}projective\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ProjectiveSpace}_S(\\mathbb{RP}^n,\\mathbb R,n)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}real\\text{-}projective\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ProjectiveSpace}_S(\\mathbb{RP}^n,\\mathbb R,n)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complex\\text{-}projective\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ProjectiveSpace}_S(\\mathbb{CP}^n,\\mathbb C,n)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complex\\text{-}projective\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ProjectiveSpace}_S(\\mathbb{CP}^n,\\mathbb C,n)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Projective space: the quotient of nonzero vectors by a set-coded scalar-equivalence relation.  The former assertion passed a predicate template where the upstream relation predicate requires an actual binary relation set.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{RP}^1 \\cong S^1\">\\(\\mathbb{RP}^1 \\cong S^1\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{CP}^1 \\cong S^2\">\\(\\mathbb{CP}^1 \\cong S^2\\)</span>, the dimension formulas, and the homology computation are downstream theorems.</li>\n<li>Cell decomposition: one cell in each dimension <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span></li>\n<li>Complex projective: Kähler manifold, Fano varieties</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Hatcher, Algebraic Topology</li>\n<li>Griffiths and Harris, Principles of Algebraic Geometry</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-equivalence-relation","status":"resolved","id":"908bc7b079f5d25b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-equivalence-relation]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S\\subseteq V^{2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProjectiveSpace}_S\\subseteq V^{3}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ScalarEquivalenceRelation}_S\\subseteq V^{3}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ScalarEquivalent}_S\\subseteq V^{4}","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"P,x,y\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ScalarEquivalent}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ScalarEquivalenceRelation}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProjectiveSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{RP}^n,\\mathbb{CP}^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projective\\text{-}scalar\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ScalarEquivalent}_S(x,y,k,n)\\leftrightarrow\nk\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\\land n\\in\\omega\\land x,y\\in k^{n+1}\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\n\\exists\\lambda\\in k\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;(y=\\lambda x)","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projective\\text{-}scalar\\text{-}relation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ScalarEquivalenceRelation}_S(E,k,n)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\nk\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\\land n\\in\\omega\\\\\n&\\land E=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in(k^{n+1}\\setminus\\{0\\})^2:\n\\mathrm{ScalarEquivalent}_S(x,y,k,n)\\}\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S(E,k^{n+1}\\setminus\\{0\\}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projective\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ProjectiveSpace}_S(P,k,n)\\leftrightarrow\nk\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\\land n\\in\\omega\\land\n\\exists E\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ScalarEquivalenceRelation}_S(E,k,n)\\land\nP=\\{[x]_E:x\\in k^{n+1}\\setminus\\{0\\}\\}\n\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}real\\text{-}projective\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ProjectiveSpace}_S(\\mathbb{RP}^n,\\mathbb R,n)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complex\\text{-}projective\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ProjectiveSpace}_S(\\mathbb{CP}^n,\\mathbb C,n)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbb{RP}^1 \\cong S^1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{CP}^1 \\cong S^2","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false}],"bytes":2621,"backlinks":[{"id":"3a6ab09b3579e778","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6046552157f71d9c","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ProjectiveSpace}_S(P,k,n)$ and $\\mathrm{ScalarEquivalenceRelation}_S(E,k,n)$ are supplied by [[58-df-projective-space]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1005","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-projective-space.md|58-df-projective-space]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["908bc7b079f5d25b"]}